ARTZ countertops, upgraded EXTENDED cabinetry, & a WALKTHROUGH SPICE KITCHEN w/direct access to the mudroom, ideal for effortless prep, hosting, & everyday convenience. Upstairs, find 3 SPACIOUS bedrooms, including a serene primary retreat w/a 5-pc spa like ensuite featuring a soaker tub, tiled shower, and generous walk in closet. A bright bonus room add another family area, plus a convenient upper laundry room, & a full bath complete this level. With a SEPARATE SIDE ENTRANCE, & a location in a vibrant, amenity rich community, it's the kind of place you'll love coming home to. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$716,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","2,207 sq ft"],["Year built","2025"],["Storeys","2"],["2026 City assessment","$634,000"],["Est. property tax","about $6,570/year ($548/month)"],["Neighbourhood","Crystallina Nera East"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5Z0W9"],["MLS® number","E4517611"],["Listed","November 26, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Hood Fan, See remarks, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Insert, Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.49m"],["Dining room","Main level","3.66m"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.26m"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.44m"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.32m"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.55m"],["Bedroom 4","Main level","3.22m"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","4.10m"]],"courtesy":"Chris Karampelas, MaxWell Polaris and Jennifer Kitzan Mohammed, MaxWell Polaris","tax_m":548,"tax_note":{"year":2026,"per_k":"10.36","city":"Edmonton","licence":"City of Edmonton open data, licensed under the Open Government Licence – City of Edmonton","estimator":"https://taxestimator.edmonton.ca/"},"board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"crystallina-nera-east","area":"northeast-edmonton"}